{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"publication\": {\n    \"ref\": \"DOI:10.1101/2025.01.10.632393\",\n    \"title\": \"Subthalamic Signature of Freezing of Gait in Parkinson’s Disease\",\n    \"publication_status\": \"preprint\",\n    \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n    \"study_id_candidate\": \"STN-FOG-LFP-Gait-GB-MOV-MAGIC-2025\",\n    \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"PD-STN-DBS-perioperative-cohort-n38-GBMOV-MAGIC\",\n    \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"原始研究，合并GB-MOV和MAGIC两个临床研究试验的38例PD患者，招募时间为2013年2月至2021年9月，研究中心为Pitié-Salpêtrière Hospital和Rouen University。文章引用Karachi et al. 2019（文献3：Clinical and anatomical predictors for freezing of gait and falls after subthalamic deep brain stimulation in Parkinson’s disease patients）。该文与本研究存在作者和研究项目关联，可能存在部分队列重叠，但本论文没有报告患者级匹配、试验分组人数或明确的队列重叠声明。因此与该2019年研究的关系标记为possible_match，不能认定为独立重复验证，也不能认定为同一队列。GB-MOV和MAGIC内部患者是否重叠未报告。补充材料未包含在本次提供的40页PDF中。\",\n    \"source_type\": \"primary\",\n    \"basis\": \"fulltext\",\n    \"fulltext_checked\": true\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E01\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性研究；双侧STN-DBS电极植入后进行仪器化步态和FOG事件记录；DOPAOFF条件下描述实际FOG发生情况。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例拟接受STN-DBS的PD患者，其中12例在DOPAOFF记录期间出现FOG，26例未观察到FOG。另有23名年龄匹配健康对照，但不属于PD患者STN-LFP主要分析样本。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 263,\n      \"n_trials\": 99,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"263为FOG事件数，不是患者数或试次数。99为包含FOG事件的试次数。有效神经数据患者人数及实际参与事件分析的电极接触数未单独报告。全文报告267个STN内双极记录dipoles，但不能将其视为物理电极数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；原文将FOG定义为步行流突然停止及不能将脚抬离地面，未区分akinetic、trembling-in-place等亚型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；12例患者在DOPAOFF记录中发生FOG，但论文未将患者临床FOG正式分类为OFF-FOG、ONOFF-FOG或其他亚型。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF：停用抗帕金森药物12小时后测试。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧STN-DBS电极已植入并外接记录线，术后1–4天记录，尚未植入神经刺激器。没有治疗性DBS刺激。刺激频率、幅度、脉宽及有效触点不适用。\",\n      \"task\": \"仪器化自然直立行走任务：听从视觉提示启动步行，在力平台上启动后直行6–8米、半转身并返回。FOG发生于直行或转弯期间。采用运动学记录和检查者现场记录确定事件。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN双极LFP同步记录；全研究保留267个STN内记录dipoles，其中后部感觉运动区139个、中央联合区128个。本条为FOG事件计数，不是神经信号效应分析。\",\n      \"measure\": \"实际FOG事件发生次数、包含事件的步行试次数及首次事件相对于步态启动的时间。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"不适用于FOG事件计数。FOG起始通过步态运动学确定，研究记录了步态启动后FOG出现的步数。\",\n      \"finding\": \"DOPAOFF条件下，12/38名患者发生FOG。99个步行试次包含FOG事件，共记录263次FOG发作。首次FOG出现时间中位数为步态启动后8步，IQR为6–11.5步。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"12/38患者；99个FOG阳性试次；263个FOG事件；首次FOG发生时间中位数8步（IQR 6–11.5）。描述性结果，无置信区间。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级FOG分类、试次级FOG阳性分类和事件级FOG计数。263次事件嵌套于99个试次及12名患者，不能视为263名独立受试者。描述性统计。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性研究领域级初评\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"受试者均为拟接受STN-DBS的手术患者；MAGIC试验额外要求DOPAOFF存在FOG，可能影响样本构成。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用运动学特征及检查者记录确认FOG，但未报告盲法独立视频裁定或FOG亚型评定。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条为行为事件计数，不以神经信号质量作为结局。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.14–15\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"不同患者组的步态及轴性障碍严重程度不同，且研究为非随机观察设计。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"263次事件来自12名患者和99个试次，事件并非独立样本。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14；Fig.1，PDF pp.32–33\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条为描述性事件计数，不涉及该结局的多重假设检验。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"本条未构建预测模型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告临床试验注册号，但未提供可供核对的完整预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"FOG事件是在受控实验室步行任务中观察，而不是日常生活连续监测。263次事件集中在12名患者的99个试次中。没有报告FOG运动学亚型。不能将事件数量解释为独立患者数量。\",\n      \"quote\": \"A total of 263 FOG episodes were recorded.\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Gait initiation performance relates to FOG predisposition and occurrence\",\n        \"page\": \"14\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.1e–g，PDF pp.32–33\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary material referenced but not included in supplied PDF\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E02\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+无事件试次与FOG-患者试次之间的STN-LFP与步态关联比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例PD患者；12例FOG+，26例FOG-。本条分析FOG+患者没有实际FOG发生的试次，与FOG-患者试次比较。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 0,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"有效神经数据患者人数及实际电极接触数未单独报告。DOPAOFF总体LFP分析报告946条traces（FOG-725，FOG+221），不是患者数或试次数。试次数存在报告差异：主文p.14报告FOG-/-为918、FOG+/-为212；Fig.3图注p.36报告分别为658和233。无法确认具体LFP分析试次分母，因此n_trials置null。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；没有区分akinetic、trembling-in-place等表型。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+是DOPAOFF记录期间实际发生过FOG的分组，并非经过正式临床药物反应表型分类。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF：停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后1–4天外接双侧STN电极记录，刺激器尚未植入，无治疗性DBS。刺激参数不适用。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动及随后直行6–8米、半转身和返回；本比较使用没有发生FOG的试次。LFP试次从视觉提示前2秒开始，记录至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN双极LFP；全STN分析。267个保留dipoles，包括后部感觉运动区139个和中央联合区128个。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN LFP theta/alpha频段功率与步态启动pace（RPC1）的时间变化关联；RPC1反映步行速度、步长和前向推进能力。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Theta/alpha为4–12 Hz。多窗谱估计，3个正交tapers，500 ms窗口，每30 ms移动一次；0–100 Hz功率以试次开始前800 ms基线归一化，转换为10×log10。试次从提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。具体显著时间窗未在正文以数值区间报告。\",\n      \"finding\": \"与FOG-患者相比，FOG+患者在没有实际FOG发生的试次中，theta/alpha功率与pace评分之间的正向关联较弱。该发现反映FOG易感患者的步态启动神经调制差异，而不是同一试次中FOG事件前的预测信号。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向为FOG+组正向关联减弱。正文未报告该特定比较的数值斜率、置信区间或精确P值；图3以时频图及显著时间区间展示。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"线性混合模型，LFP谱功率为因变量，RPC评分为连续预测变量，FOG组别、STN区域及药物状态为分类预测变量，并包含交互项；记录dipole嵌套于subject设置随机截距。通过emtrends估计斜率。FDR校正，调整后P<0.05；时频图阈值P<0.001。推断不是单纯患者级独立样本推断。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理/预测研究领域清单\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"38例均为拟接受STN-DBS的患者；MAGIC额外要求DOPAOFF存在FOG，可能富集FOG患者，两个试验的患者比例未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG采用运动学特征和检查者记录，但没有报告盲法独立裁定；FOG亚型未分类。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用自动和人工目视检查，至少两名检查者排除明显运动伪迹及饱和信号，但未报告剔除数量及残留伪迹量化。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+与FOG-组存在步态及轴性障碍严重程度差异；模型控制FOG组、区域、药物状态和RPC，但未见广泛临床协变量调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14；Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"LFP数据包含多个dipoles和重复试次；模型处理了dipole嵌套于患者的结构，但没有明确报告trial层级随机效应。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用FDR校正及P<0.001时频图阈值，但同时分析多个频段、时间点、RPC、STN区域和药物状态。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+组仅12人，PCA及关联分析来自同一研究数据，没有独立外部验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.14–17；Discussion，PDF p.22\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"报告ClinicalTrials.gov注册号，但没有提供完整预注册统计分析计划与全部结局的对应核查。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是FOG易感性分组比较，不是事件级预测。试次数存在主文和图注不一致。theta/alpha关联未提供可直接提取的数值斜率或患者级效应量。不能解释为theta/alpha功率绝对升高或降低。\",\n      \"quote\": \"FOG+ patients exhibited weaker positive associations between theta/alpha and gamma band powers and pace scores\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic activity correlates with FOG predisposition and is spatially distributed\",\n        \"page\": \"16\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.3a–c，PDF p.36\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.3 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E03\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+无事件试次与FOG-患者试次比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例PD患者，12例FOG+和26例FOG-；分析无FOG发生试次中的STN-LFP与步态启动关联。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 0,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"有效神经数据患者人数及物理电极接触数未报告。主文与Fig.3图注的无FOG试次数不一致：FOG+/-分别报告212和233；FOG-/-分别报告918和658。946条LFP traces不是试次数，故n_trials置null。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+为DOPAOFF记录期间出现过FOG的患者。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后1–4天外接电极记录，刺激器尚未植入，无治疗性DBS。\",\n      \"task\": \"仪器化步态启动、直行6–8米、半转身及返回；仅分析无实际FOG发生的试次。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN双极LFP；全STN分析，未在该结果中限定单一亚区。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN LFP gamma频段功率与pace（RPC1）的时间变化关联；RPC1表示步行速度、步长和推进能力。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Gamma定义为>35 Hz。多窗谱估计，500 ms窗口、30 ms步进、3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化，功率转换为dB。试次范围为提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+患者无FOG试次中的gamma功率与pace评分之间的正向关联弱于FOG-患者。该结果是FOG易感性相关的组间差异，不是FOG事件期间的gamma功率升高。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正向关联减弱；正文未报告该gamma特定比较的数值斜率、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"线性混合模型分析谱功率与RPC1的斜率，记录dipole嵌套于subject设置随机截距；多因素交互模型及FDR校正。具体患者级效应量未提供。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"手术候选患者样本，MAGIC额外要求DOPAOFF FOG；两个试验来源的具体比例不明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG由运动学和检查者确认，但未报告独立盲法评审及FOG亚型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实施人工和自动伪迹排除，但未报告被剔除的具体信号数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG分组伴随步态严重程度差异，未见完整临床协变量调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14；Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"dipole嵌套subject随机截距处理了部分聚类，但trial层级处理未充分说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了FDR校正，但涉及多个频段和时间点。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"无独立验证样本；FOG+患者仅12例。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.14–17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有完整预注册分析计划可供核对。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"论文将theta/alpha与gamma结果同时报告为pace关联，但没有提供各自可直接比较的数值斜率。不能将gamma与其他频段合并解释为统一的低频活动异常。\",\n      \"quote\": \"FOG+ patients exhibited weaker positive associations between theta/alpha and gamma band powers and pace scores\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic activity correlates with FOG predisposition and is spatially distributed\",\n        \"page\": \"16\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.3a–c，PDF p.36\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.3 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E04\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+无事件试次与FOG-患者试次的STN区域特异性比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例PD患者，12例FOG+、26例FOG-；分析无FOG试次。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 0,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"有效神经数据患者数和物理电极接触数未报告。FOG+/-与FOG-/-试次数在主文和Fig.3图注中不一致，不能确认本区域分析的独立试次分母。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+患者在DOPAOFF记录期间曾发生FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后1–4天外接双侧电极，无治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"无FOG发生的步态启动试次；提示后启动、直行6–8米、半转身并返回。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN。全研究该亚区139个保留dipoles。\",\n      \"measure\": \"后部STN低beta LFP功率与pace（RPC1）之间的关联斜率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta为13–20 Hz。3个tapers，500 ms窗、30 ms步进，800 ms试次前基线归一化；试次从提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+患者在后部STN中，低beta功率与pace评分呈更强的负向关联。即步态pace评分较高时，后部STN低beta功率的归一化关联更负。该结果属于FOG易感状态。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"负向关联在FOG+患者更强；没有报告可直接提取的数值斜率、置信区间或该区域比较的精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM分析STN谱功率与RPC1；FOG组、STN区域、药物状态及RPC交互；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；emtrends估计斜率；FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"手术候选样本且MAGIC额外纳入DOPAOFF-FOG患者；试验来源人数未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG以运动学和检查者记录确认，但未提供盲法独立裁定。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用双重目视检查和自动伪迹检测，但没有报告具体排除数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG分组与步态严重程度相关，未见完整混杂因素调整。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14；Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用dipole嵌套subject随机截距，但未明确说明trial层级随机效应。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用FDR，但涉及频率、时点、区域及RPC多维比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+组只有12例，无独立外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.14–17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"注册号已提供，但没有完整预设分析计划供核查。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"本结果是LFP功率与步态表现的相关斜率，不是静息低beta绝对功率，也不是beta burst持续时间、占据率或熵。区域特异性效应没有提供数值斜率。试次分母存在主文和图注差异。\",\n      \"quote\": \"stronger negative associations between low beta power and pace score in the posterior STN\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic activity correlates with FOG predisposition and is spatially distributed\",\n        \"page\": \"16\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4a–c，PDF pp.37–38\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Figs.4–5 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E05\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG易感组与非FOG组比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例PD患者；FOG+ 12例，FOG- 26例；分析无实际FOG发生的试次。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 0,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"有效神经数据患者数和物理接触数未单独报告。主文及Fig.3图注中的无FOG试次数不一致；946条DOPAOFF traces不能替代试次数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+为记录期间DOPAOFF出现过FOG的患者。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接STN电极，无治疗性DBS。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动及随后直行、转弯；无FOG发生的试次。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN及中央联合STN。全研究分别保留139和128个dipoles。\",\n      \"measure\": \"低beta LFP功率与步态节律RPC2的关联斜率；RPC2反映步频、步时及步态节律。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta 13–20 Hz；500 ms多窗估计，30 ms步进，3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化，功率以dB表示；试次从提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+患者的低beta功率与节律评分在后部和中央STN均呈负向关联。与之相比，FOG-患者中央STN中观察到正向关联。该结果提示FOG易感组的低beta-节律关联在空间分布上更广。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"FOG+组后部和中央STN均为负向关联；FOG-组中央STN为正向关联。正文未给出各亚区具体斜率、置信区间和精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM，谱功率为因变量，RPC2为连续预测变量，FOG分组和STN区域为分类预测变量；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；斜率通过emtrends估计，进行FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"手术候选患者样本；MAGIC额外要求DOPAOFF-FOG，两个试验的入组构成未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用运动学和检查者记录确认实际FOG，但没有盲法独立评审资料。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实施自动和人工伪迹检查，但没有报告剔除数量或残留伪迹量化。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG组的轴性和步态障碍较严重，不能排除其他临床差异影响LFP-步态关联。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"模型包含dipole嵌套subject随机截距，但没有明确说明trial级聚类处理。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有FDR校正，但涉及多个时频点、区域、频段和行为维度。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+组12例，未报告独立外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.14–17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"无法将结果与完整预注册统计分析计划逐项核对。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该发现是功率与节律评分的关联，而非低beta平均功率直接比较。不同STN区域的结果方向不同。文章另指出负向beta关联可延伸至高beta，但没有在该段给出独立的区域特异性数值估计。\",\n      \"quote\": \"negative associations between low beta power and rhythm in both the posterior and central STN subareas\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic activity correlates with FOG predisposition and is spatially distributed\",\n        \"page\": \"16\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4d–f，PDF pp.37–38\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.5 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E06\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG易感组与非FOG组比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例PD患者；FOG+ 12例，FOG- 26例；分析没有实际FOG事件的步态试次。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 0,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"有效神经数据患者数和物理接触数未报告。FOG+/-及FOG-/-试次数在主文与Fig.3图注不一致，不能确定该亚区分析的精确试次分母。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+定义为DOPAOFF记录中观察到过FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"双侧外接STN电极记录，术后1–4天，无治疗性DBS。\",\n      \"task\": \"仪器化步态启动和直行/转弯任务；分析无FOG试次。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN及中央联合STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"低beta LFP功率与平衡RPC5评分的关联斜率；RPC5反映步宽和侧向重心速度。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta 13–20 Hz；多窗谱估计3个tapers，500 ms窗、30 ms步进，800 ms试次前基线归一化；试次从提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+患者的低beta功率与平衡评分在后部和中央STN均呈负向关联，且后部STN效应更强；FOG-患者则观察到正向关联。该发现属于易感性状态下的平衡控制关联。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"FOG+组两个亚区均为负向关联，后部效应更强；正文没有提供数值斜率、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM分析功率与RPC5评分关系；包括FOG分组、STN区域、药物状态、RPC及交互项；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；emtrends估计斜率，FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"38例均为手术候选患者，MAGIC试验额外要求DOPAOFF-FOG，存在选择性富集可能。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG事件由运动学和检查者记录确认，但没有报告独立盲法裁定及亚型。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行自动和人工目视伪迹排除，但没有报告残留伪迹的定量评估。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG组和非FOG组步态及平衡障碍严重程度不同，其他临床混杂未充分报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用dipole嵌套subject随机截距，但trial层级的相关结构没有充分说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用FDR校正，但包含多个频段、时间点、STN亚区及RPC。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+样本仅12例，没有独立外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.14–17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有完整统计分析计划供核查，补充材料未提供。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7；Supplementary material，PDF p.26\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"低beta与平衡的负向关联不能直接等同于FOG事件发生时低beta功率下降。该结果来自无事件试次，属于易感性关联。论文没有给出各亚区精确效应量。\",\n      \"quote\": \"negative associations between low beta power and balance score in both STN subareas, with stronger effects in the posterior STN\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic activity correlates with FOG predisposition and is spatially distributed\",\n        \"page\": \"16\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4g–i，PDF pp.37–38\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.5 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E07\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+患者与FOG-患者的STN区域和时间相关性比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例PD患者；FOG+ 12例，FOG- 26例。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 38,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 0,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"有效神经数据患者数未报告；无FOG试次的主文与Fig.3图注分母不一致。物理电极接触数未直接报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+为DOPAOFF记录中曾发生FOG的患者。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接电极记录，未进行治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动前及启动期间的仪器化步行；分析FOG+和FOG-患者的步态启动数据。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN和中央联合STN；作者指出效应在后部STN显著更大。\",\n      \"measure\": \"beta频段LFP功率与平衡RPC5评分的时间相关性；该结果所述beta亚频段边界未在该句明确给出。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta频段；作者在引言定义总体beta为13–35 Hz、低beta为13–20 Hz、高beta为21–35 Hz，但该特定正向关联未明确指定亚频段。报告关联从步态启动前开始；时频分析使用500 ms窗、30 ms步进、800 ms基线归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+患者在步态启动前即表现出beta功率与平衡评分的正向相关，并且该相关在后部STN显著强于其他区域。该发现与同一论文报告的低beta功率与平衡评分负向关联并存，但二者的时间窗及频段描述并不完全相同。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正向关联；后部STN效应更大。未提供具体频率边界、数值斜率、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM及时间分辨谱功率-RPC关联；记录dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。具体正向beta关联的模型系数未在正文列出。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"手术候选患者样本，且MAGIC试验额外要求DOPAOFF-FOG。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG使用运动学和检查者记录确认，但没有报告独立盲法视频评审。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用自动及人工目视伪迹排除，但没有定量报告排除比例。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+患者步态和平衡障碍更严重，可能同时影响beta调制及平衡评分。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"模型考虑dipole与subject嵌套，但trial级随机结构未明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用FDR校正，但存在多频段、多时间窗和多区域分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"样本较小，未进行独立队列验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.14–17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"缺少可核对的完整预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这一正向beta-平衡关联没有明确的亚频段边界，不能直接归类为低beta或高beta。其时间起点在步态启动前，而其他负向低beta关联主要在步态启动后报告。不能在未核查原始时频图的情况下将两者视为同一效应。\",\n      \"quote\": \"a pronounced positive correlation between beta band activity and balance score starting before gait initiation\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Subthalamic activity correlates with FOG predisposition and is spatially distributed\",\n        \"page\": \"16\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.4g–i，PDF pp.37–38\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.5 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E08\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；在FOG+患者内部比较随后出现实际FOG的试次与未出现FOG的试次。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例FOG+患者；FOG+/+为包含实际FOG事件的试次，FOG+/-为没有FOG事件的试次。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 263,\n      \"n_trials\": 99,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"99为包含FOG的试次数。非事件对照试次在主文报告212、Fig.3图注报告233，存在不一致。事件比较的每组有效LFP traces和患者级有效神经数据人数未单独报告。267个dipoles为记录位置数而非物理电极接触数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported；论文没有报告akinetic或trembling-in-place分类。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；这些患者在DOPAOFF记录期间出现实际FOG，但临床药物反应亚型未正式分类。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后1–4天外接双侧STN电极记录；尚无治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"先进行步态启动，再直行6–8米并半转身返回；FOG+/+试次中FOG发生于启动后，首次FOG中位数为8步。神经分析针对启动阶段而非FOG实际冻结期间。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN；并与中央联合STN比较。该效应被报告为后部STN特异性。\",\n      \"measure\": \"高beta LFP功率与pace RPC1的关联斜率；RPC1反映步行速度、步长和推进能力。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"高beta 21–35 Hz。500 ms多窗估计，30 ms步进，3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化，10×log10转换。LFP试次从提示前2秒到第二次摆动期结束；FOG通常在启动后数步出现。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在FOG+患者中，随后出现FOG的试次与未出现FOG的试次相比，高beta功率与pace评分之间出现更强的负向关联，而且这一差异仅在后部STN显著。该神经变化发生于同一试次的FOG实际出现之前。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"负向关联增强，后部STN显著；正文未提供精确斜率、置信区间或数值P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"FOG+/+与FOG+/-试次比较；LMM分析时频谱功率与RPC评分关联，dipole嵌套subject随机截距。论文未单独提供该事件比较的患者级系数。263次FOG事件嵌套于99个试次。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理/预测研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件分析仅包含12名发生过FOG的手术患者，样本小且来自两个临床试验。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7；Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用运动学和检查者确认FOG，但没有报告独立盲法视频评审。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有自动和双人目视伪迹筛查，但未提供事件试次的信号剔除数。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+患者内部比较降低了患者间混杂，但未完全控制试次级任务表现及事件诱发因素。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"263次事件集中于99个试次和12名患者；LMM考虑dipole嵌套subject，但事件级聚类未充分报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14；Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"存在多频段、多个RPC、多个STN区域及时间点比较，虽使用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"作者明确指出每名患者可用FOG事件数量有限，难以开发个体分类器；未进行外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，PDF p.22\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有完整预注册分析计划供核对。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是同一试次中FOG发生前的关联，不是实际冻结期间的神经信号。FOG事件数263不能作为独立样本数。论文未报告个体预测敏感度、特异度或外部验证。\",\n      \"quote\": \"stronger negative associations between high beta band power and pace score in FOG+/+ vs. FOG+/- trials, significant only in the posterior STN\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Predictive patterns of FOG occurrence\",\n        \"page\": \"17\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5a–c，PDF p.39\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.6 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E09\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+患者内部比较事件试次与无事件试次。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例FOG+患者；99个包含FOG的试次及FOG+/-无事件试次。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 263,\n      \"n_trials\": 99,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"99个FOG阳性试次明确报告。无事件对照试次数主文为212、Fig.3图注为233。事件分析有效神经数据患者数及试次级有效dipoles数量未单独报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；记录期间FOG在DOPAOFF出现，临床药物反应亚型未正式分类。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"外接双侧STN电极，术后1–4天，未进行治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动、直行及半转身；FOG+/+试次中FOG在启动后出现。分析时窗位于实际冻结之前。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN；与中央联合STN进行区域比较。\",\n      \"measure\": \"高beta LFP功率与步态节律RPC2的关联斜率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"高beta 21–35 Hz；500 ms窗，30 ms步进，3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化；试次从提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+/+试次中，后部STN高beta功率与步态节律之间出现正向关联；这一关系在FOG+/-无事件试次中不存在或方向相反。该变化与同一试次随后出现实际FOG相关。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"FOG+/+中正向关联出现，FOG+/-中缺失或反向；没有报告具体斜率、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM分析谱功率与RPC2关系；FOG事件试次与非事件试次比较；记录dipole嵌套subject随机截距；多重比较FDR校正。事件级独立样本数未报告。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理/预测研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅12名FOG+患者贡献事件分析，事件分布不均。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用运动学和检查者记录确认实际FOG，但没有独立盲法评审资料。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了自动及双人目视伪迹筛查，但没有提供事件试次剔除数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者内比较减少患者间差异，但任务状态和试次级步态差异仍可能影响关联。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件嵌套于试次和患者；没有充分报告事件级聚类处理。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14；Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多频段、区域和时间点比较，使用FDR但分析维度较多。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"样本和个体事件数量有限，没有独立预测验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，PDF p.22\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有完整预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"高beta与节律的正向关联发生在后部STN，并且是事件相关的启动期变化；不能将其描述为整个STN在冻结期间高beta平均功率升高。具体事件预测提前量未报告为秒数。\",\n      \"quote\": \"positive association between rhythm and both high beta and theta band activity emerged in the posterior STN during FOG+/+ trials\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Predictive patterns of FOG occurrence\",\n        \"page\": \"17\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5d–f，PDF p.39\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.6 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E10\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+患者内部事件试次与非事件试次比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例FOG+患者；FOG+/+试次与FOG+/-试次。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 263,\n      \"n_trials\": 99,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"FOG+/+为99个事件试次；FOG+/-对照试次数主文报告212，Fig.3图注报告233。有效神经数据患者数未单独报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；临床FOG药物反应亚型未正式分类。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接双侧STN电极，未进行治疗性DBS。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动后直行及转弯；仅FOG+/+试次在同一试次后续实际出现FOG。神经关联分析位于启动阶段。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Theta频段LFP功率与步态节律RPC2的关联斜率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Theta属于4–8 Hz范围；论文时频分析覆盖0–100 Hz，500 ms窗、30 ms步进，3个tapers，800 ms试次前基线归一化。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+/+试次中，后部STN theta功率与步态节律出现正向关联；FOG+/-无事件试次中该关联缺失或方向相反。该发现是独立于高beta的频段结果。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正向关联在FOG+/+中出现；未报告独立数值斜率、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM分析谱功率与RPC2；FOG事件试次与非事件试次比较；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。没有报告独立患者级效应量。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理/预测研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"仅12例FOG+患者参与事件比较，且为STN-DBS手术候选患者。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7；Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG由运动学和检查者记录确认，但未报告盲法独立视频裁定。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有自动及人工检查，但没有报告事件相关theta信号的具体剔除比例。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者内比较减少组间混杂，但未控制全部试次级步态状态。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件嵌套于试次和患者，事件级聚类处理未充分报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多频段和多时点分析，采用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+患者仅12例，没有外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，PDF p.22\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有提供完整预注册统计分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该theta结果与高beta结果涉及同一节律结局，但属于不同频段，应分别保存。论文没有给出theta效应的独立数值系数或明确的预测提前量。\",\n      \"quote\": \"positive association between rhythm and both high beta and theta band activity emerged in the posterior STN during FOG+/+ trials\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Predictive patterns of FOG occurrence\",\n        \"page\": \"17\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5d–f，PDF p.39\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.6 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E11\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+患者事件试次与非事件试次比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例FOG+患者；99个FOG+/+试次及FOG+/-对照试次。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 263,\n      \"n_trials\": 99,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"99个事件试次已报告；非事件试次数量存在主文212与图注233的差异。有效神经患者人数和事件分析的实际电极接触数未单列。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；记录期DOPAOFF出现FOG，但未正式临床分型。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接双侧STN电极，未进行治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动、直行和转弯；FOG+/+试次中随后出现实际冻结。LFP关联发生于步态启动阶段。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"中央联合STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"高beta LFP功率与平衡RPC5评分的关联斜率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"高beta 21–35 Hz；500 ms窗、30 ms步进、3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化；试次从提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在FOG+患者中，FOG+/+试次出现中央STN高beta功率与平衡评分之间更强的负向关联。该结果属于同一试次随后出现FOG之前的启动期神经变化。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"负向关联增强；正文未给出具体数值斜率、置信区间和精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM分析高beta功率与RPC5；患者内事件试次与非事件试次比较；记录dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理/预测研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件分析样本为12名FOG+手术候选患者。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用运动学及检查者确认事件，但没有独立盲法裁定。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用自动和人工伪迹检查，但没有单独报告中央STN事件相关信号剔除情况。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者内比较减少患者间混杂，但试次级任务需求及步态状态未完全控制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"263次事件嵌套于99个试次和12名患者，事件级相关性处理不充分明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多频段、区域及时间点比较，使用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有独立验证集，作者指出个体FOG事件数有限。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，PDF p.22\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未提供完整预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果描述的是中央STN高beta功率与平衡评分的负向关联，不是中央STN高beta绝对功率升高。与后部STN高beta-节律正向关联应视为不同区域、不同行为结局。\",\n      \"quote\": \"a stronger negative association between high beta band power in the central STN\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Predictive patterns of FOG occurrence\",\n        \"page\": \"17\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5g–i，PDF p.39\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.6 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E12\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+患者内部事件试次与无事件试次比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 263,\n      \"n_trials\": 99,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"99个FOG阳性试次已报告；对照试次数存在主文212与Fig.3图注233的差异。有效神经数据患者人数未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；记录期间DOPAOFF发生FOG，未报告临床药物反应分型。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后1–4天外接双侧STN电极，无治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动后直行6–8米、半转身并返回；FOG+/+试次中后续出现实际FOG。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Gamma LFP功率与平衡RPC5评分的关联斜率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Gamma >35 Hz；500 ms窗、30 ms步进、3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化，功率转换为dB。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+/+试次中，后部STN gamma功率与平衡评分出现正向关联。该结果与中央STN高beta功率和平衡评分的负向关联是不同的区域和频段发现。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正向关联；未报告具体斜率、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM分析谱功率与RPC5关系；患者内事件试次与非事件试次比较；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理/预测研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件分析仅包括12名FOG+手术患者。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"运动学与检查者记录用于FOG确认，但独立盲法评审未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有双人目视及自动伪迹筛查，但未报告gamma频段残留伪迹量化。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者内比较仍可能受到试次级平衡、任务状态和运动表现差异影响。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件、试次和dipoles具有嵌套结构，事件级相关性未充分描述。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"涉及多个频段、时间窗、区域和RPC，虽使用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有独立外部验证，事件样本规模有限。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，PDF p.22\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"缺少完整预注册分析计划供核对。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"gamma和平衡关联是FOG后续发生试次的启动期结果，不能据此断言冻结实际发生时gamma功率增加。具体时频统计量没有在正文提供。\",\n      \"quote\": \"positive association with gamma band power in the posterior STN\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Predictive patterns of FOG occurrence\",\n        \"page\": \"17\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5g–i，PDF p.39\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.6 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E13\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF与DOPAON重复测量；FOG+患者组内药物状态比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例DOPAOFF记录期间出现过FOG的PD患者；DOPAON时除1名患者存在残余FOG外，其余患者冻结症状完全缓解，残余FOG试次被排除。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": 349,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"349为DOPAON记录中FOG+患者组报告的试次数；残余FOG患者的相关试次被排除，但排除数量及最终神经分析的精确试次数未单独报告。DOPAON共875条LFP traces，其中FOG+组242条；这些是traces，不是患者数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+患者在DOPAOFF记录中有实际FOG，但临床OFF-FOG/ONOFF-FOG分类未正式报告。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAON：在12小时停药后给予超阈值左旋多巴剂量，即患者通常晨间左旋多巴剂量加50 mg；与DOPAOFF比较。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接STN电极记录，刺激器尚未植入，无治疗性DBS。\",\n      \"task\": \"仪器化步态启动、直行6–8米及半转身；DOPAON分析FOG+患者中未出现残余FOG的试次。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN双极LFP，全STN分析；图6采用与图3相同的分析框架。\",\n      \"measure\": \"低beta LFP功率与pace RPC1评分的关联斜率；药物前后方向变化。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta 13–20 Hz；500 ms多窗估计，30 ms步进，3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化，10×log10转换。试次从提示前2秒至第二次摆动期结束。\",\n      \"finding\": \"在FOG+患者中，低beta功率与pace评分的关联在DOPAOFF时为负向；DOPAON后转向正向，趋近FOG-患者的关联模式。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"关联方向由负转正；没有报告该变化的具体斜率差、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"DOPAOFF与DOPAON状态的LMM比较；谱功率为因变量，RPC1为连续预测变量，药物状态及其与其他预测变量的交互纳入模型；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理及非随机药物状态比较\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+组只有12例，且来自两个不同临床试验，MAGIC有额外FOG入组要求。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG采用运动学和检查者确认，但没有独立盲法评审及亚型分类。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"自动及双人目视检查伪迹，但没有报告DOPAON具体排除数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态非随机交叉顺序，可能与测试时间、疲劳和其他临床状态混杂。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental protocol，PDF p.9\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"同一患者多个dipoles和试次，模型设置dipole嵌套subject随机截距，但trial级结构未完全说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"比较多个药物状态、区域、频段和行为RPC，采用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+组12例，没有独立验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.17–18\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有完整预注册分析计划可用于核对所有药物状态比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果是药物状态对LFP-步态关联斜率的影响，不是低beta绝对功率在ON时必然升高。DOPAON残余FOG试次被排除，因此不能将结果解释为ON-FOG事件机制。\",\n      \"quote\": \"In FOG+ patients, dopamine treatment shifted associations between low beta band power and pace from negative (DOPAOFF) toward positive\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Dopaminergic medication improves gait disability and reestablishes STN activity\",\n        \"page\": \"17\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.6c–e，PDF p.40\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary material referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E14\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF与DOPAON药物状态重复测量；FOG+患者组内比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例FOG+患者；DOPAON时1例存在残余FOG，其残余FOG试次被排除。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": 349,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"DOPAON FOG+组349个试次为论文报告值，但残余FOG试次排除数量没有单列。有效患者级神经数据人数未报告；242条FOG+组LFP traces不是患者数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；记录期间FOG主要在DOPAOFF出现，临床药物反应亚型未分类。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF：停药12小时；DOPAON：通常晨间左旋多巴剂量加50 mg。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接STN电极，未进行治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"仪器化步态启动任务；DOPAON分析未出现残余FOG的FOG+患者试次。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN双极LFP；图6采用图3相同的全STN分析框架。\",\n      \"measure\": \"STN beta LFP功率与步态节律RPC2评分之间的关联；该结果句未明确指定beta亚频段。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"Beta亚频段在该结果句中未明确。论文时频估计采用500 ms窗、30 ms步进、3个tapers、800 ms试次前基线归一化。图6采用与图3相同的分析框架。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG+患者在DOPAOFF状态下观察到的beta功率与节律之间的负向关联，在DOPAON状态下减弱。原文该句使用beta band power，没有在句中明确写明是低beta还是高beta。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"负向关联减弱；无可提取的具体斜率差、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM比较药物状态与RPC2评分的谱功率关联；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。该特定节律比较的频段亚型未在结果句中明确。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理及非随机药物状态比较\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+样本12例，来自两个临床研究试验。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG由运动学及检查者记录确认，但未报告独立盲法评审。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用自动和人工检查，但没有报告药物状态比较中剔除的具体信号数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态非随机，可能受到测试顺序和时间因素影响。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental protocol，PDF p.9\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个dipoles和试次嵌套于患者，trial层级结构未充分说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个频段、行为RPC、区域和药物状态，采用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"样本较小且没有独立外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.17–18\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"无法核对完整预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"特别需要保留原文beta未指定亚频段这一点，不能自行改写为低beta。图6采用图3相同分析，但不能据此替代结果句缺失的具体亚频段描述。\",\n      \"quote\": \"the negative association with beta band power observed in FOG+ patients was reduced with dopamine treatment\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Dopaminergic medication improves gait disability and reestablishes STN activity\",\n        \"page\": \"18\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.6d–e，PDF p.40\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary material referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E15\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF与DOPAON重复测量；FOG+患者组内药物状态比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"12例FOG+患者；DOPAON时残余FOG患者的相关试次被排除。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": 349,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"349为DOPAON FOG+组报告试次数；残余FOG试次排除数量未单独报告。有效神经数据患者数未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG+组根据DOPAOFF记录中实际FOG划分。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF停药12小时；DOPAON给予通常晨间左旋多巴剂量加50 mg。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"外接STN电极记录，未进行治疗性DBS。\",\n      \"task\": \"步态启动及仪器化步行任务；DOPAON中FOG+患者无残余FOG试次。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"STN双极LFP；图6与图3相同分析框架，全STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"低beta LFP功率与平衡RPC5评分之间的关联斜率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta 13–20 Hz；500 ms窗，30 ms步进，3个tapers，800 ms试次前基线归一化，10×log10转换。\",\n      \"finding\": \"DOPAOFF时FOG+患者低beta功率与平衡评分的负向关联，在DOPAON后得到减弱，趋近DOPAON条件下FOG-患者的关联模式。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"负向关联减弱；正文未提供具体斜率、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM分析谱功率与RPC5评分；比较DOPAOFF与DOPAON状态；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理及非随机药物状态比较\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG+组仅12例，且来自两个不同研究试验。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"FOG由运动学和检查者确认，但没有报告盲法独立裁定。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用自动及双人目视检查，但未提供DOPAON具体剔除数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态非随机，可能与测试时间及患者状态混杂。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental protocol，PDF p.9\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多个dipoles和试次嵌套于患者，trial级随机结构未完全说明。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多频段、区域和RPC比较，采用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有独立外部验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.17–18\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有完整预注册分析计划供核对。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该结果反映低beta功率与平衡评分关联的变化，不能等同于绝对功率恢复或DBS刺激效应。研究未进行治疗性DBS。\",\n      \"quote\": \"dopaminergic treatment mitigated the negative association between low beta power observed in the DOPAOFF condition in FOG+ patients\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Dopaminergic medication improves gait disability and reestablishes STN activity\",\n        \"page\": \"18\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.6d–e，PDF p.40\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary material referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E16\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF与DOPAON重复测量；FOG-患者组内药物状态比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"26例FOG-患者；在DOPAOFF记录中没有观察到FOG。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 26,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 0,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 0,\n      \"n_trials\": 902,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"902为DOPAON记录中FOG-组报告的试次数，不是有效神经数据患者数。875条DOPAON LFP traces中FOG-组633条。实际物理接触数未报告。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；FOG-表示DOPAOFF记录期间未观察到FOG，不代表已证明患者终身无FOG。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF停药12小时；DOPAON给予通常晨间左旋多巴剂量加50 mg。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接STN电极记录，未进行治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"仪器化步态启动及行走任务；FOG-患者在DOPAOFF和DOPAON状态下比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"双侧STN双极LFP，全STN分析。\",\n      \"measure\": \"低beta LFP功率与pace RPC1评分的关联斜率。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta 13–20 Hz；500 ms多窗估计、30 ms步进、3个tapers；800 ms试次前基线归一化，转换为dB。\",\n      \"finding\": \"FOG-患者中，低beta功率与pace评分呈正向关联；DOPAOFF与DOPAON之间该关联变化较小。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"正向关联；药物状态间变化较小。未报告具体斜率差、置信区间或精确P值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"LMM比较谱功率与RPC1关系及DOPAOFF/DOPAON状态；dipole嵌套subject随机截距；FDR校正。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理及非随机药物状态比较\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"均为接受STN-DBS的手术候选患者，FOG-组定义为研究记录期间未观察到FOG。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7；Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用运动学和检查者记录，但未报告独立盲法评审。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"有自动和人工目视检查，但未报告各组信号剔除数量。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物状态非随机，未充分报告所有临床混杂因素。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Experimental protocol，PDF p.9\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用dipole嵌套subject随机截距，但trial级随机结构不明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"多频段、时间点和RPC比较，使用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告独立外部验证队列。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF pp.17–18\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"无法核对完整预注册分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods，PDF p.7\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"FOG-是基于研究记录期间没有观察到事件的分类，不能据此推断患者终身没有FOG。该结果属于药物状态下的步态编码关联，不是FOG事件预测指标。\",\n      \"quote\": \"positive associations between low beta band power and pace score in FOG- patients, with minimal changes between DOPAOFF and DOPAON condition\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Dopaminergic medication improves gait disability and reestablishes STN activity\",\n        \"page\": \"17\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.6a–b，PDF p.40\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary material referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"E17\",\n      \"design\": \"围手术期观察性电生理研究；DOPAOFF；FOG+患者实际事件试次与无事件试次比较。该条提取论文摘要对低beta变化的总体报告，正文未给出独立数值分解。\",\n      \"population\": \"38例PD患者；FOG+ 12例、FOG- 26例；事件相关比较主要涉及12例FOG+患者。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 38,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 12,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": 263,\n      \"n_trials\": 99,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"99为FOG阳性试次数，263为事件数。摘要没有提供该低beta变化对应的独立试次数、有效患者数或精确dipole分母。无事件对照试次数存在主文与Fig.3图注差异。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"pre_FOG_event_associated\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown；实际FOG发生于DOPAOFF记录，但临床药物反应亚型未正式分类。\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"DOPAOFF，停药12小时。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"术后外接STN电极记录，无治疗性刺激。\",\n      \"task\": \"实际直立行走和转弯；FOG+/+试次在步态启动后发生实际冻结。分析重点是启动期神经变化。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"后部感觉运动STN和中央联合STN。\",\n      \"measure\": \"低beta功率去同步化及其与步态启动参数的关联；摘要没有明确指出该条结果对应pace、rhythm还是balance中的哪一个单独RPC。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta 13–20 Hz；论文采用500 ms多窗估计、30 ms步进、800 ms试次前基线归一化。具体低beta去同步化变化的独立时间窗及RPC对应关系未在摘要中列明。\",\n      \"finding\": \"摘要报告，FOG事件发生前，后部和中央STN区域的低beta去同步化关联受到破坏。正文结果部分主要分别报告高beta与pace、节律、平衡以及gamma与平衡的事件相关关联，没有为这一低beta总体描述提供独立的数值系数或完整RPC分解。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"方向为低beta去同步化关联受到破坏；没有独立斜率、置信区间或P值。该结果应保留为作者摘要层面的总体报告，不能进一步推断具体哪个RPC的效应。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"作者将该结果置于FOG发生前的事件相关STN活动模式中。LFP分析总体采用LMM及dipole嵌套subject随机截距；本条低beta总体描述没有独立报告其具体统计对比和模型系数。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated：观察性电生理/预测研究\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件分析仅涉及12名FOG+手术患者。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants，PDF p.7；Results，PDF p.14\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"实际FOG采用运动学和检查者记录确认，但独立盲法裁定未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Gait recordings，PDF p.11\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量/伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用自动和人工目视伪迹检查，但没有报告低beta事件相关信号的单独质量统计。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Electrophysiological data processing，PDF p.12\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者内比较减少部分混杂，但未充分报告任务、步态及事件级混杂控制。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.17\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量/伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"事件嵌套于试次和患者，事件级相关性处理未充分报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results，PDF p.14；Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"整体分析包含多频段、多区域、多RPC和时间点，使用FDR校正。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Statistical analyses，PDF p.13\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合/外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有独立外部验证，作者指出FOG事件数量不足以支持个体分类器开发。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion，PDF p.22\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"摘要中的低beta总体描述没有在正文提供独立效应估计，完整预注册分析计划不可核对。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Abstract，PDF p.3；Results，PDF p.17\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"此条不能与E05、E06的无事件低beta关联直接合并。摘要报告的是FOG事件相关的低beta去同步化破坏，但没有明确给出独立RPC、精确时间窗或区域特异性斜率。应保留为低beta事件相关总体证据，并标注定量细节不足。\",\n      \"quote\": \"a disruption in low beta desynchronization across both posterior and central STN regions\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Abstract；Discussion—FOG signature within the STN\",\n        \"page\": \"3；21\",\n        \"figure_table\": \"Fig.5，PDF p.39\",\n        \"supplement\": \"Supplementary Fig.6 referenced but not supplied\"\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "37d594a1-2dbd-47b7-9990-0287c8dbb9f1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T105805247904Z", "elapsed_seconds": 522.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:06:47.987930+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0415cbd1e4e6882610c3971fc41dbef482c6839433f291549725589b1fe8ef47", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_